        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Fall of Singapore</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Date</span><span class="info-stat-val">8 to 15 February 1942; Percival surrendered on the afternoon of 15 February, shortly after 17:15</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Place</span><span class="info-stat-val">The island of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/singapore">Singapore</a>, across the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/johor">Johor</a> Strait from the Malayan mainland, then a British possession (present-day Singapore)</span></div>
